    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop right there, Kal'tsit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, did you think things through, or...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
        "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You wanted this, right? Take it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
        "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You acted unilaterally, without permission.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "I do not interfere in the private affairs of our operators, nor do I ask them what they did in their free time - as long as they do not tarnish Rhodes Island's reputation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hope that whatever you did does not cost you your position in Rhodes Island, Skadi.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
        "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not here for your snide remarks. I'm well aware of the rules. You needed something from me, and I need something from you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
        "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you want from me then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
        "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Information.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "ac1_ex6",
        "x": -100,
        "y": 0,
        "xScale": 1.2,
        "yScale": 1.2,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "imagetween",
        "xFrom": -100,
        "yFrom": 0,
        "xTo": 0,
        "yTo": 0,
        "xScaleFrom": 1.2,
        "yScaleFrom": 1.2,
        "xScaleTo": 1.2,
        "yScaleTo": 1.2,
        "duration": 10,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
        "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you consider the information I have to be worth as little as this key?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
        "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I can crush this stone in my palm in a heartbeat. I'm sure you don't want that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
        "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What I do know is that you went to Dewville in Kazimierz under pretenses of being on a mission, and even got into a conflict with a fellow operator.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "She kept quiet about what happened both there and at Rhodes Island for your sake. But in fact, I never assigned any such mission to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
        "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm? The core has already been filled with blood. This is not your blood. You wouldn't dare shed your own blood onto this soil.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
        "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's Grani's blood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
        "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You've already done something like this...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
        "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll repay her. You don't need to remind me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know this is what you need. A key, a core, a memory block... whatever it might be. I just have to obtain it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Skull,' 'Flamelung,' 'Yellow Smog'... I took them all out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Otherwise, they surely would have taken this item. You wouldn't be able to barter with them, because you can't give them what they want.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "You need this 'stone,' and I need the information you have.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
        "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What a farce. I don't need any of these... components... to form the full picture.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're bound to Rhodes Island by contract, and you're bound to me likewise.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
        "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You give me what I need, and I give you what you need.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
        "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I rarely see you this aggressive. Where's your usual laziness and snark?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You want to know where Spectre's Originium nerve agent came from.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "...How'd you find out?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "(\u00c6girian) 'Abyssal Hunters are bound by blood.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "There's nothing I don't know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Give me the info.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
        "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_infirmary",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Very well. As long as you follow my every order, I might even decide to help you. The condition is, as long as you follow my every order.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
        "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I only follow those who are trustworthy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I never go back on my word.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image"
    }
]